{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想養成規律習慣卻總是半途而廢？Nitra 是一款專為簡化習慣追蹤而設計的工具，讓你用最直覺的方式記錄每日進度、查看累積成果。目前 App 正在限時免費，原價 US $2.99，特別適合需要視覺化激勵與數據回饋的使用者。</p>\n\n<h2>直觀圖表與日曆檢視</h2>\n<p>Nitra 提供計數圖表，讓你一眼比較不同習慣的執行表現；日曆則能以多種模式同時顯示所有習慣，方便快速掌握整月節奏。加上視覺化的連續紀錄條，每次完成都能強化成就感，幫助你穩定維持動力。此外，App 內建建議習慣清單與 iCloud 同步功能，無論更換裝置或剛開始規劃，都能輕鬆上手。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-154-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-155-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-156-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-157-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-158-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-159-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Nitra | Habit Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-27T23:43:59.971888+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}